This small building, a house and a laboratory at the same time, is adorned with antennas from all sides. It belongs to Nikolas Swift, a very respectable citizen of Mech-City. Though he is strange like all other scholars, he knows a lot. There are also many interesting technical things in his laboratory, which are fascinating to boys. When you come to the door, it opens by itself, inviting you to enter. You wonder how Nikolas' devices know that you are here?